{% extends 'mail/layout.txt.twig' %}

{% block content %}
Hello {{ name }},

{% if what == 'app' %}
Two-factor sign-in for your account ({{ email }}) was set up again, with a new authenticator app or phone. Codes from the old one no longer work, the old recovery codes no longer work either, and you're signed out on your other devices.
{% else %}
Your account ({{ email }}) has new recovery codes. The old ones no longer work.
{% endif %}

When: {{ when }}
Browser: {{ browser }}
IP address: {{ ip }}

If this was you, there's nothing to do.

If it wasn't you, ask whoever looks after this website to reset your account straight away.
{% endblock %}

{% block why %}You get this because this is your account on the website's control panel. Slim Killer emails you whenever its two-factor changes.{% endblock %}
